      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Allen Ingvar Olson is an American Republican politician and attorney who served as the 28th Governor of North Dakota from 1981 to 1985. He was born in Rolla, North Dakota, and received a law degree from the University of North Dakota."</data>
